{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguefall is an action rogue-lite following a lost player guided by the enigmatic Overseer to scavenge a world forgotten by humanity. Fight, explore, collect, and fall until you reach the final machine: 0VR5R.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER A FORGOTTEN WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a crumbling world filled with remnants of the past and watched over by curious wildlife and ancient constructs. Test your skills in procedurally generated dungeons made of meticulously hand-crafted rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/e7815a82e6f28fae1e5d0c8381384588.poster.avif?t=1773762400\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/e7815a82e6f28fae1e5d0c8381384588.webm?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/e7815a82e6f28fae1e5d0c8381384588.mp4?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deeper to uncover lost shops, gather ores and mysterious essences, awaken dormant machines, and dismantle wandering drones to gain an edge on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/fcbbeb265c3112ed06096880e8226a8f.poster.avif?t=1773762400\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/fcbbeb265c3112ed06096880e8226a8f.webm?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/fcbbeb265c3112ed06096880e8226a8f.mp4?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW STRONGER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade mysterious machines that grant permanent buffs. Equip five unique weapons, each with its own playstyle, and collect over 50 treasures with special effects. Modify treasures at ruined machines to tailor them to your strategy. Level up and spend points on attributes that suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/76704087cbb3faa6f8dd1bb78b952c9d.poster.avif?t=1773762400\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/76704087cbb3faa6f8dd1bb78b952c9d.webm?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/76704087cbb3faa6f8dd1bb78b952c9d.mp4?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEAT THE FINAL MACHINE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 0VR5R, the final machine, an intricately designed boss that will challenge your skill and strategy. What awaits after its defeat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/78b6eff262d3fe2380afc6b29b1503ed.poster.avif?t=1773762400\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/78b6eff262d3fe2380afc6b29b1503ed.webm?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/78b6eff262d3fe2380afc6b29b1503ed.mp4?t=1773762400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3471820?t=1773762400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/1b849606e0a9a123ab1005cc05f83da4e43232a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773762400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/3cb83e510f96572c54e09bc3db2a8bfd59878999/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773762400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/3cb83e510f96572c54e09bc3db2a8bfd59878999/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773762400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3558340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguefall is an action rogue-lite following a lost player guided by the enigmatic Overseer to scavenge a world forgotten by humanity. Fight, explore, collect, and fall until you reach the final machine: 0VR5R.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER A FORGOTTEN WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a crumbling world filled with remnants of the past and watched over by curious wildlife and ancient constructs. Test your skills in procedurally generated dungeons made of meticulously hand-crafted rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/e7815a82e6f28fae1e5d0c8381384588.poster.avif?t=1773762400\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471820/extras/e7815a82e6f28fae1e5d0c8381384588.webm?t=1773762400